Third-party names appearing in Atlas belong to their respective owners and are
used only to identify their products.


14. NO CONFIDENTIALITY OBLIGATION

This licence imposes no confidentiality or non-disclosure obligation on you.
"Proprietary" here describes who owns Atlas; it does not mean you have agreed
