Any separate confidentiality agreement would be a different document. This is
not one.


15. ENDING THIS LICENCE

The Licensor may end this beta licence at any time, and it ends automatically
if you breach it. If the controlled beta ends, this licence ends with it.

When it ends, stop using Atlas and delete or return the copies of the
Atlas-Owned Material you hold — except a modified copy you keep under section
7.

Ending this licence does not require you to delete or stop using Your Data or
Your Outputs. It does not require you to delete any Third-Party Component you
are entitled to keep under its own licence, and it does not affect any right
you have under a Third-Party Component's licence: those rights come from their
licensors, not from this licence.

Sections 3, 7, 9, 12, 13, 16, 17 and 18 survive the end of this licence.


